== matrix exclude removes Windows
file: .github/workflows/ci.yml
message: the verify command `task verify` runs on no Windows runner (called in .github/workflows/ci.yml job v)
fix: run `task verify` on Windows too, such as with a matrix over os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest] and runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}

