== an expression that is not one matrix value
file: .github/workflows/ci.yml
message: the verify command `task verify` runs on no Linux or Windows runner (called in .github/workflows/ci.yml job v); runners of unknown platform: ${{ matrix.runner || matrix.os }}
fix: run `task verify` on Linux and Windows too, such as with a matrix over os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest] and runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}

