== another CI provider
file: .circleci/config.yml
message: contract 1.2.0 reads GitHub Actions and GitLab CI only, and this repository's CI is .circleci/config.yml
fix: run CI in GitHub Actions under .github/workflows/ or in GitLab CI (.gitlab-ci.yml), or wait for a vibe that reads this provider

